          "from": "Proto-Otomi *phaoʔi 'help'",
          "to": "fatsꞌi /ɸàt͡sʔi/",
          "note": "The Otomi aspirate series (from earlier stop + h) became fricatives in most Western dialects; in Mezquital ⟨f⟩ is [ɸ], while *th is kept, as in *gošthi > gosthi 'door'."
        },
        {
          "from": "Proto-Otomi *šiphani 'skin'",
